{"words": [{"text": "۞ وَلَقَدْ", "translation": "And certainly"}, {"text": "أَخَذَ", "translation": "took"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مِيثَـٰقَ", "translation": "a Covenant"}, {"text": "بَنِىٓ", "translation": "(from the) Children"}, {"text": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translation": "(of) Israel"}, {"text": "وَبَعَثْنَا", "translation": "and We appointed"}, {"text": "مِنْهُمُ", "translation": "among them"}, {"text": "ٱثْنَىْ", "translation": "two"}, {"text": "عَشَرَ", "translation": "(and) ten"}, {"text": "نَقِيبًۭا ۖ", "translation": "leaders"}, {"text": "وَقَالَ", "translation": "And said"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "إِنِّى", "translation": "Indeed, I (am)"}, {"text": "مَعَكُمْ ۖ", "translation": "with you"}, {"text": "لَئِنْ", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "أَقَمْتُمُ", "translation": "you establish"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "translation": "the prayer"}, {"text": "وَءَاتَيْتُمُ", "translation": "and give"}, {"text": "ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ", "translation": "the zakah"}, {"text": "وَءَامَنتُم", "translation": "and you believe"}, {"text": "بِرُسُلِى", "translation": "in My Messengers"}, {"text": "وَعَزَّرْتُمُوهُمْ", "translation": "and you assist them"}, {"text": "وَأَقْرَضْتُمُ", "translation": "and you loan"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "(to) Allah"}, {"text": "قَرْضًا", "translation": "a loan"}, {"text": "حَسَنًۭا", "translation": "goodly"}, {"text": "لَّأُكَفِّرَنَّ", "translation": "surely I will remove"}, {"text": "عَنكُمْ", "translation": "from you"}, {"text": "سَيِّـَٔاتِكُمْ", "translation": "your evil deeds"}, {"text": "وَلَأُدْخِلَنَّكُمْ", "translation": "and I will surely admit you"}, {"text": "جَنَّـٰتٍۢ", "translation": "(to) gardens"}, {"text": "تَجْرِى", "translation": "flow"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "تَحْتِهَا", "translation": "underneath them"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۚ", "translation": "the rivers"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "But whoever"}, {"text": "كَفَرَ", "translation": "disbelieved"}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "فَقَدْ", "translation": "then certainly"}, {"text": "ضَلَّ", "translation": "he strayed"}, {"text": "سَوَآءَ", "translation": "(from) the way"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّبِيلِ", "translation": "the right"}], "sahih": "And Allāh had already taken a covenant from the Children of Israel, and We delegated from among them twelve leaders. And Allāh said, \"I am with you. If you establish prayer and give zakāh and believe in My messengers and support them and loan Allāh a goodly loan,1 I will surely remove from you your misdeeds and admit you to gardens beneath which rivers flow. But whoever of you disbelieves after that has certainly strayed from the soundness of the way.\""}